                "content": "## Runtime configuration\n\nThe fields correspond to the script's CLI arguments:\n\n- `mode`: `\"smoke\"`, `\"delayed\"`, `\"weight-decay\"`, or `\"fraction-sweep\"`\n- `output_dir`: directory for PNG plots, or `None` to avoid saving them\n- `steps`: override the selected mode's default optimization-step count, or `None` to use the script default\n- `show_plots`: display plots inline\n\nThe delayed mode reproduces the paper-faithful Figure 1 path and runs three seeds. Its default is 1,000,000 steps per seed, so set `steps` to a smaller value for iteration."
              }
            },
