                ],
                "structuredContent": {
                  "result": [
                    {
                      "cellType": "markdown",
                      "source": "# Grokking: first-pass reproduction\n\nThis notebook is the interactive front end for `experiments/01_grokking/scripts/first_pass_grokking.py`. It imports and runs the script's implementation directly, so its dataset construction, model architecture, optimization, evaluation, plotting, and experiment defaults stay exactly aligned with the CLI.\n\nChoose a runtime configuration below, then run all cells.",
                      "execution_count": null,
                      "cell_id": "98d19147"
                    },
                    {
                      "cellType": "markdown",
                      "source": "## Runtime configuration\n\nThe fields correspond to the script's CLI arguments:\n\n- `mode`: `\"smoke\"`, `\"delayed\"`, `\"weight-decay\"`, or `\"fraction-sweep\"`\n- `output_dir`: directory for PNG plots, or `None` to avoid saving them\n- `steps`: override the selected mode's default optimization-step count, or `None` to use the script default\n- `show_plots`: display plots inline\n\nThe delayed mode reproduces the paper-faithful Figure 1 path and runs three seeds. Its default is 1,000,000 steps per seed, so set `steps` to a smaller value for iteration.",
                      "execution_count": null,
                      "cell_id": "c0b2d3e2"
                    },
                    {
                      "cellType": "code",
                      "source": "CONFIG = {\n    \"mode\": \"smoke\",\n    \"output_dir\": None,\n    \"steps\": None,\n    \"show_plots\": True,\n}\n\nCONFIG",
                      "execution_count": null,
                      "cell_id": "e98efd44",
                      "language": "python"
                    },
                    {
                      "cellType": "code",
                      "source": "import importlib.util\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\ndef find_script() -> Path:\n    relative_path = Path(\"experiments/01_grokking/scripts/first_pass_grokking.py\")\n    for root in (Path.cwd(), *Path.cwd().parents):\n        candidate = root / relative_path\n        if candidate.is_file():\n            return candidate\n    raise FileNotFoundError(\n        f\"Could not find {relative_path} from {Path.cwd()} or any parent directory.\"\n    )\n\n\nSCRIPT_PATH = find_script()\nmodule_spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(\"first_pass_grokking\", SCRIPT_PATH)\nif module_spec is None or module_spec.loader is None:\n    raise ImportError(f\"Could not load {SCRIPT_PATH}\")\n\ngrokking = importlib.util.module_from_spec(module_spec)\nsys.modules[module_spec.name] = grokking\nmodule_spec.loader.exec_module(grokking)\n\nprint(f\"Loaded implementation from: {SCRIPT_PATH}\")\nprint(f\"Using device: {grokking.DEVICE}\")",
                      "execution_count": null,
                      "cell_id": "b194af7f",
                      "language": "python"
                    },
                    {
                      "cellType": "markdown",
                      "source": "## Run the selected experiment\n\nThis mirrors the script's `main()`: seed the runtime, print the dataset preview, and dispatch to the selected mode with the configured plot and step options.",
                      "execution_count": null,
                      "cell_id": "76659bff"
                    },
                    {
                      "cellType": "code",
                      "source": "mode = CONFIG[\"mode\"]\noutput_dir = Path(CONFIG[\"output_dir\"]) if CONFIG[\"output_dir\"] is not None else None\nsteps = CONFIG[\"steps\"]\nshow_plots = CONFIG[\"show_plots\"]\n\ngrokking.seed_everything(42)\ngrokking.print_preview_example()\n\nif mode == \"smoke\":\n    grokking.run_smoke(output_dir, show_plots)\nelif mode == \"delayed\":\n    grokking.run_delayed_generalization(output_dir, show_plots, steps)\nelif mode == \"weight-decay\":\n    grokking.run_weight_decay_mode(output_dir, show_plots, steps)\nelif mode == \"fraction-sweep\":\n    grokking.run_fraction_sweep_mode(output_dir, show_plots, steps)\nelse:\n    raise ValueError(f\"Unsupported mode: {mode}\")",
                      "execution_count": null,
                      "cell_id": "7bd46ae5",
                      "language": "python"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "_meta": {
                  "fastmcp": {
                    "wrap_result": true
                  }
                }
              },
              "error": null
            }
